    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SHEILA: Now where were we?\nGWEN: Your turn, Don Juan.\nGWEN: My God, what is that?\nSHEILA: What?",
      "MISS LUCKMORE: Such an intimate document of finesse and joy.\nBABS: Nice to see a catalogue with ladies bigger than me for once.\nMISS LUCKMORE: In whispers from the canary to the owl. Pray tell, your measurement would be?\nBABS: Guess.",
      "MISS LUCKMORE: Instantly.\nJOCELYN: Excuse me, I was here first.",
      "MISS LUCKMORE: Such a fascinating item of marvel. Its touch to the skin, its contour on the body.\nJOCELYN: I will be served first! There’ll be this cinnamon bra, thank you very much.\nMISS LUCKMORE: I have a coin that will spin and decide.",
      "JOCELYN: I was at this tray and you shove in with that ghastly dress of yours. So if you don’t mind, wait your turn!\nFRIEND OF JOCELYN: You alright there, Jocelyn?\nJOCELYN: Yeah, just some idiot woman who doesn’t know how to queue.\nMISS LUCKMORE: Blame! .. Blame!"
    ]
  },
